('127.402.d.7.A',3,'A good problem statement tells who has the problem, what the problem is, and:','["what color to use", "why it matters", "when lunch is", "who the mascot is"]'::jsonb,1,'Statements give context and importance.','original'),
('127.402.d.7.A',4,'The statement ''Wheelchair users cannot reach top shelves in the school library'' names the:','["schedule", "budget", "people affected and the problem", "materials"]'::jsonb,2,'It identifies who and what.','original'),
('127.402.d.7.B',3,'One method to refine a problem statement is to:','["guess", "copy another", "hide it", "interview users"]'::jsonb,3,'User input sharpens focus.','original'),
