('127.402.d.7.C',3,'A measurable problem statement includes:','["a feeling", "a number or limit that can be tested", "a name", "a color only"]'::jsonb,1,'Measurable means testable.','original'),
('127.402.d.7.C',4,'Which statement is most specific and measurable?','["Backpacks are heavy.", "Make better backpacks.", "Reduce backpack weight to under 10 pounds for ninth graders.", "Students carry things."]'::jsonb,2,'It states a target and group.','original'),
('127.402.d.7.D',3,'After writing a problem statement, a team should collect:','["nothing", "only opinions", "unrelated data", "information that helps to understand the problem"]'::jsonb,3,'Gather relevant data.','original'),
('127.402.d.7.D',4,'Survey data from 50 students shows most carry over 15 pounds. This information helps the team to:','["confirm the need", "end the project", "raise the price", "pick a color"]'::jsonb,0,'Data supports the problem.','original'),
